From ff37be5771f61b40907ba7378d4b4477c2ea787c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: aswin-mcw <aswin.kalies@multicorewareinc.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 01:52:41 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 10/12] ARM64: Add a test for HVAs of two to four NEON vectors

It covers the Q3/Q4 cases of extend_hfa_type in win64_armasm.S, which
loaded the third and fourth vectors from the wrong offset before
32d1d61.  Against that older code the ffi_call results for HVA3 and
HVA4 were wrong (140 and 308 instead of 188 and 420).

List va_hfa.c and hva_neon.c in testsuite/Makefile.am and Makefile.in.
